 in your inventory. Use Choose Cursed Sentry talent to alter your selection.\n\t\t\tAt talent level 3, you get the ability to afflict powerful mundane objects (greater egos).\n\t\t\tAt talent level 5, you can corrupt artifacts.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"将你身上的一部分活性诅咒灌注到物品栏的一件武器中，并把它投向附近。这个近乎坚不可摧的诅咒护卫会攻击附近所有敌人，持续 %d 回合。诅咒结束时，武器会掉落在地面上。\n\t\t诅咒护卫的攻击速度随技能等级提高（当前 %d%%）。\n\t\t首次选择武器后，只要它仍在物品栏中，就会被记住并继续使用。使用“选择诅咒护卫”技能可更改选择。\n\t\t技能等级达到 3 时，你可以将带有高级词缀的强力普通武器化为护卫。\n\t\t技能等级达到 5 时，你可以将神器化为护卫。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"02e16a5194ac09befe80b6d055d31871e7a67b6483e9ca43164cfeaf8f145426","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1e28aef34d2695c0c295c696cc1518069a2a7220105d8b394f9bec5b11389200","logical_entry_identity":"118d81baf0a5e8cbe199130e3b605857a0eecc71be59587444d332b1a430226f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your deep link with Nature allows you to reset the cooldown of %d of your wild gifts of tier %d or less.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你与大自然间的深刻联系，使你能够立刻冷却 %d 个技能层次不超过 %d 的自然系技能。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3b742a30390f667f6df7706010f0f069565855ca5983c6d0957f6c81f0dfbc3f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1e29520ff992429f1573f1750c791998ca13b0f4335954971110190b2ada6177","logical_entry_identity":"78516d140e073eb72456c59bff631d0e889c106acfbbf1695ff1408a345aa5d6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You conceal spring loaded blades within your equipment. On scoring a critical strike, you follow up with your blades for %d%% damage (as an unarmed attack).\nThis talent has a cooldown.\n#YELLOW#Prepared with: %s#LAST#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你将刀片隐藏在装备中，当你对临近目标造成暴击时，刀片自动弹出，造成 %d%% 徒手武器伤害。\n该技能有冷却时间。\n#YELLOW#已装填：%s#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9aeaad87bce1419fb8a074099259e747ebbb0a3669844e53322a52387019d558","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1e29e217281ec82cd06f5f7e9512442d7d6765445858e61c504bf453d0de8264","logical_entry_identity":"d485344644e74f9622260753d849c32c88cf49c59c5e260